          "lines": [
            "          78 Heic Kandic Hei Mu Nyngsumhpui Kandic e",
            "                             11.11.8.8. Ref. 9. 9.9.9",
            "          Doh hei E",
            "",
            "          1. Heic kandic hei mu nyngsumhpui kandic e.",
            "             Heicpui 'dic ta Jisu ruina gulou the.",
            "             Kata lwm o neihlaa bam khang.",
            "             Heic kandic ta damclou khwan e.",
            "",
            "                      He lwmlou lak cho nzianmei guay,",
            "                      Kaganv rui nang ta nkhwan mak ge.",
            "                      Kaipouc rui nang ta kawna bam khou;",
            "                      Bumaengh ta nsaa 'rai bam tu cho?",
            "",
            "          2. Ravguangc rui 'niw ta baanh zaapna kaw bam e.",
            "             Bumaengh amaan nimei khourui hanguang o.",
            "             Mbaanv chwn guay 'patlou ngamna,",
            "             Bumaengh ringc nimei guay guang o.",
            "",
            "          3. Aniw panty mu matat khatna khang de:",
            "             Kaganv tingmik hei katumcna duiguang the.",
            "             Baanh zaapna kaw bam khwan sihnic,",
            "             Kaganv hei ngalanc dat lak khe."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
